{"id":"n63923-1-2","stage":4,"title":"손꼽히다 · 数一数二","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n63923-1-2-1","ko":"지수가 그렇게 그림을 잘 그려?","zh":"智秀的画画得真的那么好吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지수가","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"지수가","audio":"/audio/979e8723b1f704e0856a.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지수가","audio":"/audio/979e8723b1f704e0856a.mp3"}},{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그렇게","audio":"/audio/b470a873a66143d27846.mp3"}},{"text":"그림을","meaning":"画儿，绘画，画作，图画","explanation":"그림：画儿，绘画，画作，图画；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"그림","audio":"/audio/c143fe9e8e3a2db7a2c3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29687","senseId":"1","lemma":"그림","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그림을","audio":"/audio/d24e3982ec2821e39100.mp3"}},{"text":"잘","meaning":"很好地，熟练地","explanation":"잘：很好地，熟练地","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"1","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}},{"text":"그려?","meaning":"画","explanation":"그리다：画；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"그리다","audio":"/audio/729cbc127a38cc4c4f21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57277","senseId":"1","lemma":"그리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그려","audio":"/audio/e62e0b8bb7a514f2b825.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"c143fe9e8e3a2db7","term":"그림","zh":"画儿，绘画，画作，图画","audio":"/audio/c143fe9e8e3a2db7a2c3.mp3","entryId":"29687","definition":"用线条或色彩把事物的模样或形象等表现在平面上的东西。","pronunciation":["그ː림"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"很好地，熟练地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"熟悉而擅长地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"729cbc127a38cc4c","term":"그리다","zh":"画","audio":"/audio/729cbc127a38cc4c4f21.mp3","entryId":"57277","definition":"利用铅笔或毛笔等以线条或色彩来表现事物。","pronunciation":["그ː리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/93c8b904dffa576009d5.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n63923-1-2-2","ko":"그럼, 전국에서 손꼽힐 정도라니까.","zh":"是啊，好到可以说是全国数一数二的水平呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그럼,","meaning":"那么，既然那样","explanation":"그럼：那么，既然那样","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60346","senseId":"2","lemma":"그럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}},{"text":"전국에서","meaning":"全国","explanation":"전국：全国；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"전국","audio":"/audio/9269373d05d5697512ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62412","senseId":"1","lemma":"전국","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"전국에서","audio":"/audio/062cc6eb149c43ac03b0.mp3"}},{"text":"손꼽힐","meaning":"数一数二","explanation":"손꼽히다：数一数二；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"손꼽히다","audio":"/audio/780e64563e2954507c6b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63923","senseId":"1","lemma":"손꼽히다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"손꼽힐","audio":"/audio/edd0de827e65d0b48207.mp3"}},{"text":"정도라니까.","meaning":"程度","explanation":"정도：程度；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라니까：再次强调已经说过的内容，非敬语：“都说了……”。","readings":[{"term":"정도","audio":"/audio/1a771e4b7f99176bc0a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70876","senseId":"1","lemma":"정도","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정도라니까","audio":"/audio/37ae160de7c67a9b6989.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"86f87d3fb9919f14","term":"그럼","zh":"那么，既然那样","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3","entryId":"60346","definition":"用于表示接受前文内容，或以前文为基础，提出新的主张。","pronunciation":["그럼"]},{"id":"9269373d05d56975","term":"전국","zh":"全国","audio":"/audio/9269373d05d5697512ee.mp3","entryId":"62412","definition":"整个国家全体。","pronunciation":["전국"]},{"id":"780e64563e295450","term":"손꼽히다","zh":"数一数二","audio":"/audio/780e64563e2954507c6b.mp3","entryId":"63923","definition":"被认为很杰出，在多个中可以进入前五。","pronunciation":["손꼬피다"]},{"id":"1a771e4b7f99176b","term":"정도","zh":"程度","audio":"/audio/1a771e4b7f99176bc0a6.mp3","entryId":"70876","definition":"表现事物的性质或价值好坏或多少的程度的分量或水准。","pronunciation":["정도"]}],"audio":"/audio/777f9607850d24ea34c4.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.558,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=63923","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":128,"sequenceScore":2.3847,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["是啊，好到可以说是全国数一数二的水平呢。","为什么穿黑西装？谁家有人去世了吗？","智秀的画画得真的那么好吗？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["是啊，好到可以说是全国数一数二的水平呢。","智秀的画画得真的那么好吗？","为什么穿黑西装？谁家有人去世了吗？"],"answer":0}]}
